"You have requested to encrypt this message, and to encrypt a copy to "
"yourself, but no valid trusted encryption keys have been configured for this "
"identity."
msgstr "Zatražili ste šifriranje ove poruke i kopije za sebe, ali za ovaj identitet nisu podešeni valjani pouzdani ključevi za šifriranje."

