#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:645
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"One or more of your configured OpenPGP encryption keys or S/MIME "
"certificates is not usable for encryption. Please reconfigure your "
"encryption keys and certificates for this identity in the identity "
"configuration dialog.\n"
"If you choose to continue, and the keys are needed later on, you will be "
"prompted to specify the keys to use."
msgstr ""
"Neki od vaših konfiguriranih ključeva za šifriranje OpenPGP-om ili "
"certifikata S/MIME-a nisu upotrebljivi za šifriranje. Ponovno konfigurirajte "
"ključeve za šifriranje i certifikate za ovaj identitet u dijaloškom okviru "
"za konfiguraciju identiteta.\n"
"Ako odlučite nastaviti, a ključevi vam kasnije budu potrebni, zatražit će se "
"da navedete ključeve koje želite koristiti."

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:655 composer/keyresolver.cpp:1008
#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1037
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Unusable Encryption Keys"
msgstr "Neupotrebljivi ključevi za šifriranje"

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:687
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"One or more of your configured OpenPGP signing keys or S/MIME signing "
"certificates is not usable for signing. Please reconfigure your signing keys "
"and certificates for this identity in the identity configuration dialog.\n"
"If you choose to continue, and the keys are needed later on, you will be "
"prompted to specify the keys to use."
msgstr ""
"Neki od vaših konfiguriranih ključeva za potpisivanje OpenPGP-om ili "
"certifikata S/MIME-a nisu upotrebljivi za potpisivanje. Ponovno "
"konfigurirajte ključeve za potpisivanje i certifikate za ovaj identitet u "
"dijaloškom okviru za konfiguraciju identiteta.\n"
"Ako odlučite nastaviti, a ključevi vam kasnije budu potrebni, zatražit će se "
"da navedete ključeve koje želite koristiti."

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:697 composer/keyresolver.cpp:1066
#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1084
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Unusable Signing Keys"
msgstr "Neupotrebljivi ključevi za potpisivanje"

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:998
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Examination of recipient's encryption preferences yielded that the message "
"should be encrypted using OpenPGP, at least for some recipients;\n"
"however, you have not configured valid trusted OpenPGP encryption keys for "
"this identity.\n"
"You may continue without encrypting to yourself, but be aware that you will "
"not be able to read your own messages if you do so."
msgstr ""
"Provjera preferencija primatelja za šifriranje pokazala je da poruku treba "
"šifrirati OpenPGP-om barem za neke primatelje;\n"
"međutim, za ovaj identitet niste konfigurirali valjane pouzdane ključeve za "
"šifriranje OpenPGP-om.\n"
"Možete nastaviti bez šifriranja kopije za sebe, no imajte na umu da tada "
"nećete moći čitati vlastite poruke."

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1027
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Examination of recipient's encryption preferences yielded that the message "
"should be encrypted using S/MIME, at least for some recipients;\n"
"however, you have not configured valid S/MIME encryption certificates for "
"this identity.\n"
"You may continue without encrypting to yourself, but be aware that you will "
"not be able to read your own messages if you do so."
msgstr ""
"Provjera preferencija primatelja za šifriranje pokazala je da poruku treba "
"šifrirati S/MIME-om barem za neke primatelje;\n"
"međutim, za ovaj identitet niste konfigurirali valjane certifikate za "
"šifriranje S/MIME-om.\n"
"Možete nastaviti bez šifriranja kopije za sebe, no imajte na umu da tada "
"nećete moći čitati vlastite poruke."

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1059
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Examination of recipient's signing preferences yielded that the message "
"should be signed using OpenPGP, at least for some recipients;\n"
"however, you have not configured valid OpenPGP signing certificates for this "
"identity."
msgstr ""
"Provjera preferencija primatelja za potpisivanje pokazala je da poruku treba "
"potpisati OpenPGP-om barem za neke primatelje;\n"
"međutim, za ovaj identitet niste konfigurirali valjane certifikate za "
"potpisivanje OpenPGP-om."

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1067
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Do Not OpenPGP-Sign"
msgstr "Ne potpisuj OpenPGP-om"

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1077
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Examination of recipient's signing preferences yielded that the message "
"should be signed using S/MIME, at least for some recipients;\n"
"however, you have not configured valid S/MIME signing certificates for this "
"identity."
msgstr ""
"Provjera preferencija primatelja za potpisivanje pokazala je da poruku treba "
"potpisati S/MIME-om barem za neke primatelje;\n"
"međutim, za ovaj identitet niste konfigurirali valjane certifikate za "
"potpisivanje S/MIME-om."

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1085
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Do Not S/MIME-Sign"
msgstr "Ne potpisuj S/MIME-om"

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1147
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Examination of recipient's signing preferences showed no common type of "
"signature matching your available signing keys.\n"
"Send message without signing?"
msgstr ""
"Provjera preferencija primatelja za potpisivanje nije pronašla zajedničku "
"vrstu potpisa koja odgovara vašim dostupnim ključevima za potpisivanje.\n"
"Želite li poslati poruku bez potpisa?"

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1151
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "No signing possible"
msgstr "Potpisivanje nije moguće"

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1314
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You did not select an encryption key for yourself (encrypt to self). You "
"will not be able to decrypt your own message if you encrypt it."
msgstr ""
"Niste odabrali ključ za šifriranje vlastite kopije poruke (šifriranje za "
"sebe). Ako šifrirate poruku, nećete moći dešifrirati vlastitu poruku."

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1317 composer/keyresolver.cpp:1342
#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1358
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Missing Key Warning"
msgstr "Upozorenje o nedostajućem ključu"

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1333
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You did not select an encryption key for the recipient of this message; "
"therefore, the message will not be encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Niste odabrali ključ za šifriranje za primatelja ove poruke, stoga poruka "
"neće biti šifrirana."

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1337
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You did not select an encryption key for any of the recipients of this "
"message; therefore, the message will not be encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Niste odabrali ključ za šifriranje ni za jednog primatelja ove poruke, stoga "
"poruka neće biti šifrirana."

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1350
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You did not select an encryption key for one of the recipients: this person "
"will not be able to decrypt the message if you encrypt it."
msgstr ""
"Niste odabrali ključ za šifriranje za jednog od primatelja: ta osoba neće "
"moći dešifrirati poruku ako je šifrirate."

#: composer/keyresolver.cpp:1354
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You did not select encryption keys for some of the recipients: these persons "
"will not be able to decrypt the message if you encrypt it."
msgstr ""
"Niste odabrali ključeve za šifriranje za neke od primatelja: te osobe neće "
"moći dešifrirati poruku ako je šifrirate."

